  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PFM capacity building - TA PIP co-financed DFID</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PFM kapacitetsst&#xF6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity development of Public Financial Management, with special emphasis on capacity to perform public investment analysis, and implement Public Investment Policy. The support was made up of two components where one component was co-financing with DFID of a consultant. The other component was similarly for consultancies, but is wholly financed by Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till kapacitetsutveckling av offentlig finansiell styrning, med s&#xE4;rskild inriktning p&#xE5; f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rkt kapacitet v.g. kvalitetss&#xE4;kring av offentliga investeringar. St&#xF6;det bestod av tv&#xE5; komponenter: komponent 1 var gemensamfinansiering med DFID av en konsult som. Komponent 2 var likaledes f&#xF6;r konsulttj&#xE4;nster och finansieras enbart av Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
